      "intent": "Explore a user-selectable context-aware toolbar: concise permanent Insert, Format, Visual/Source, Export controls; a contextual formatting strip near selected text; a searchable all-actions panel that stays keyboard reachable. Pins: 1 permanent essential commands; 2 selection-specific tools; 3 search exposes the complete command set. Show this as an optional workflow, not forced automatic personalization.",
